# Retire policy 2026-11-20: still in production in 2026 with no announced end; retire dates commented out. Revisit when an end is announced.
# BYD Sealion 7 five-door electric SUV, 2025 onwards.
#
# The Sealion 7: the electric coupe-SUV with the 82.5 kWh Blade battery, the
# sloping rear roof and the full-width tail bar. UK pricing and specification
# were announced on 10 December 2024 and the car went on sale in the first
# quarter of 2025. The Sealion 6 is a plug-in hybrid and is not represented.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BYD_Sealion_7
#
# Dimensions 4.830 x 1.925 x 1.620 m, wheelbase 2.930 m (BYD UK media
# specification table; Autocar of 13 November 2025 gives the same figures and
# 2.190 m over mirrors).
#
# Shape reference: NO true level side elevation was obtainable. Image 1 is
# about 12-15 degrees off the side axis at about 1.4 m, so the flank is
# estimated within the published dimensions and the limitation is recorded.
#
# Colours: grade (d); Shark Grey is the only UK name recorded, and the
# modelled colourways use plain names. Weights 12, 10, 9, 8, total 39,
# provisional.
#
# Speed 180 km/h. Comfort 95/473, on the line 330 + 1.5 x 95: a quiet,
# spacious electric SUV. Classes 1,2.
# Dates: intro January 2025, the first quarter of UK sale; retire dates
# commented out (still in production in 2026).
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/byd-sealion-7.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/byd-sealion-7.dae. References:
# citycars/references/byd-sealion-7/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Accepted deviations: the flank is estimated from an oblique monochrome
# photograph, the only side view available. Both spoilers are present; lamp
# internals, wheel spokes and diffuser sculpting are simplified. The proud
# panoramic glazing adds about 14 mm above the nominal painted roof height.


obj=citycar
name=BYDSealion7(White)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=12
intro_year=2025
intro_month=1
#retire_year=2051
#retire_month=6
speed=180
length=3
class=1,2
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=95
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=473

